WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A clock has twelve minutes. Time is real.
A promised hour of benefit is a different claim.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A study tested thirteen daily minutes over eight weeks.
It did not test this product.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Another study compared ten and twenty minutes once.
No twelve-versus-sixty equivalence was tested.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12's seller describes twelve-minute sessions,
twelve levels and audio choices.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try quiet practice for twelve minutes.
Record what happened, without making a medical claim.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources and try the free Focus Fieldbook.
Any future earning link requires approval and disclosure.
